[36m(TaskRunner pid=1063442)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1063442)[0m After calculating the distances and summing them up, we find that the minimum value of \(f(X)\) is \(72 + 20\sqrt{3}\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1063442)[0m 
